# The tier3 image is built from this checkout, so its build context is the repository root and
# everything left here is copied into the image. Patterns are matched against the path relative
# to the context root, so a bare name only matches at the top level: nested locations need an
# explicit `**/` prefix or leftover caches and build artifacts still change the context checksum.
**/.git

# Caches
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.coverage

# Build artifacts
**/build/
**/dist/
**/*.egg-info/
**/*.egg
**/develop-eggs/
**/eggs/
**/parts/
**/objs/
**/*.so
**/*.mo
**/_cptbox.cpp

# Local virtualenvs and editor state; a stray venv would shadow the /env built below
env*/
.venv/
.tox/
**/.idea/
